{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_04_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:095af0319477a17211c13c199df1bb7cf94bf008426b3c88d196c68b757f6dab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bd69be1bbc07dde404301c2c2e66efe28f3c67936aaa997a37086762d5b5cbb",
      "text": "那么，在本次‘制作部门’中大显身手的\n这几位，也请为我们献上舞台表演吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3c0bf6f10821763260a78da132eea21bb0e01389f6926e3161fc416ea0e16f",
      "text": "他们就是DRAMATIC STARS的各位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d7cb0bd52805db5d9f74c0feae4ac93654c259078bae80b87ad694baba17411",
      "text": "接下来轮到我们来热场子了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:320a3f3b5432e359ede6a7e9b649739affc5d9b1878c6f4c65bc4b78de46599e",
      "text": "身为偶像的前辈，可得拿出能让老爷爷心服口服的\n舞台给他瞧瞧啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00d1c585d77ac0f5254e51e40dddceefa9ab298d16866e04f448bf73b7e59c63",
      "text": "我们也会为了带给大家笑容而努力的。\n和可靠的伙伴、辉先生还有薰先生一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75149aa1767e6dbcdad4d3d3525d4011b31199d52e8b55ff794ae0ba799895cd",
      "text": "（……现在，唯有歌唱。直到传达至那些逝去的岁月）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17a14eff9819ab6486607724d38e058b01340f8bb2f46dda39b410f5a8d57617",
      "text": "（DRAMATIC STARS的表演一开始，\n演播室内的热情就越来越高涨……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1397124f7a4aa7ca6b2e3a8a123ac873ccb21fd9d2312eb8b49091800a4748",
      "text": "刚才那段舞，太炸了吧！\n三个人不是配合得天衣无缝嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9a9315807902af958ecf49e8f4131739687d8a1ea7aed54eb5533feb572ccde",
      "text": "唱歌也好厉害啊。在指导老爷爷的同时，\n他们自己居然也练到了这种水准吗……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc3b536235eeb37cec30c307aec697685827637c554ecebf9b0474cf5f406bb1",
      "text": "而且……看起来，非常开心呢……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792c9aa9cdf3c6b9b24d577510891f8b9d8786c4d97cf89172af5237b7d38512",
      "text": "没毛病！3个人都活力四射，\n帅得闪瞎眼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa31194962c09097a37a008913a3b2cd8c8f28a1d3dd13edbd1b22c4e0a2a8f",
      "text": "……真好啊，DRAMATIC STARS。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2b95626fffbc0edec1e0398833f80f3a85e257048a89485a3024a65129b0eeb",
      "text": "我高中毕业成了大人以后，\n也想跟他们一样，一直一直那样闪闪发光啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
